What the MIT License above does not cover

The license above applies to the original work in this repository. The
following are not ours to license. They are included because the mod needs
them to work alongside Natural Selection 2, and they remain under their
owners' terms:

1. Code derived from Unknown Worlds Entertainment's ServerWebInterface.lua.
   lua/ServerWebInterface.lua began as a copy of the game's own file
   ("Copyright (c) 2012, Unknown Worlds Entertainment, Inc. All rights
   reserved."), and the probes in tools/spikes/*-probe.lua are built from it.
   The vanilla code in those files belongs to Unknown Worlds Entertainment.
   Our changes to them, marked "improved-webadmin:", are under the MIT License.

2. Art taken from Natural Selection 2, (c) Unknown Worlds Entertainment:
   the map overviews in panel/src/minimaps/, the skill tier badges in
   panel/src/assets/skill-tiers.png, the NS2 monogram in
   panel/src/assets/ns2-logo.png, and their built copies in web/assets/.
   Natural Selection 2 is a trademark of Unknown Worlds Entertainment.

3. The ns2panel.com mark drawn by panel/src/ui/Ns2PanelIcon.tsx belongs to
   ns2panel.com.

4. Text read from other software: the command help in
   panel/src/commands.json comes from the game's and Shine's Lua, and keeps
   their owners' terms.

5. Data captured from Steam and from game servers: Workshop titles,
   descriptions and ids in fixtures/ and panel/src/whitelist.json belong to
   their authors and to Valve.

6. Third-party libraries bundled into web/ (Preact, uPlot, Lucide). Their
   licenses are in panel/public/THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt, which the build
   copies into web/.

This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Unknown Worlds
Entertainment, Valve, or the Shine or ns2panel.com projects.
